[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4280.95, "timestamp": "01:11:20", "text": "如果你的場景集合損壞了，可以嘗試執行…嘗試刪除…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4284.07, "timestamp": "01:11:24", "text": "你可以刪除它，或把它重命名為其他名稱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4286.79, "timestamp": "01:11:26", "text": "。或者你也可以使用備份文件，只需刪除備份文件，然後將其歸檔或從"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4289.669, "timestamp": "01:11:29", "text": "這個文件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4292.63, "timestamp": "01:11:32", "text": "夾中取出。  請再次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4299.35, "timestamp": "01:11:39", "text": "確認備份是否正常。  如果這兩種方法都不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4302.07, "timestamp": "01:11:42", "text": "奏效，或是出現其他問題，你可以做的就是……呃，不要同時使用這兩種方法。如果第一個不起作用，請"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4305.83, "timestamp": "01:11:45", "text": "在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4307.83, "timestamp": "01:11:47", "text": "新"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4308.177, "timestamp": "01:11:48", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "HA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4310.31, "timestamp": "01:11:50", "text": "場景集合上再次檢查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4315.03, "timestamp": "01:11:55", "text": "。新建一個就行了。  新的場景。  是的，你應該新建一個場景，然後檢查 OBS 是否正常運作。如果正在啟動，則開啟 Vive Studio。你"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4317.144, "timestamp": "01:11:57", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "HAGS was on critical on the log"}]